From 00ead42d9caa23a61c84cdd475a60af2f7438a80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 13 Nov 2022 19:08:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-66407] gaudi3: pcie_fw: copy phy fw to pcie sram

Pcie phy fw is copied from flash to FW sram along with the PPBOOT
app by the bootrom. But in order to perform the Pcie Phy FW upgrade
it should be placed in the PCIE SRAM. On cold boot PPBOOT app
is copying the phy fw from FW SRAM to PCIE SRAM using the PSOC
MEM_CPY engine.

Change-Id: Ic640402b76b9b01dc373a461517396bf8b00b63e
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

